ub-arr">&#8250;</span>Wafer Probe &amp; Final Test</a><span class="cap-sub-leaf cap-removed"><span class="cap-sub-arr">&#8250;</span>Die Attach &amp; Wire Bond</span></div></details>
<div class="sc-hero-band" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--band cap-section--hero"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;">
    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">OSAT · Power Packages — SiC &amp; GaN</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">Power Packages — SiC &amp; GaN</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">SiC and GaN devices place demanding requirements on package thermal performance, electrical isolation, and current handling.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="/images/photos/cap-osat-power-packages-hero.webp" alt="Discrete and module power packages including TO-247, TO-220, DPAK and clip-bonded power modules" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;" /></div>
